.TH RGBA 1
.SH NAME
rgba \- Game Boy Advance and Game Boy emulator (Rust port of mGBA)
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B rgba
.RI [ rom.gba | rom.gb ]
.RI [ options ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B rgba
emulates the Game Boy Advance (ARM7TDMI) and Game Boy/Game Boy Color
(SM83) consoles, mirroring mGBA's timing semantics. It includes a
debugger, cheats, savestates, recording and link-cable emulation.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.BI \-\-bios " file"
Use the given GBA BIOS image (HLE BIOS otherwise).
.TP
.BI \-\-gb\-model " model"
Boot model for Game Boy ROMs (dmg, cgb, sgb, mgb, sgb2, scgb).
.TP
.BR \-h ", " \-\-help
Show the full list of options.
.SH FILES
Settings and save data live under the user's XDG config/data
directories.
.SH LICENSE
MPL-2.0, like the mGBA project it is ported from.
